      "content": "REST API for managing packages, feeds, and artifact dependencies in Azure Artifacts. Supports NuGet, npm, Maven, Python, and Universal package formats in private or public feeds. Enables programmatic management of package feeds, discovery of packages and their versions, and lifecycle operations such as deprecating or deleting package versions.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Microsoft Azure DevOps",
